  "notes": [
    "A balance chain (the owner's decision of 6 Oct 2026): read-v6's chain-balances reads it only when a request asks for it (`tokens`). No Domino V2 deployment, index, plan or automation runs here, so it is not a Domino chain profile (api-contracts/v2/chains) and names only what a balance and its qualified USD read.",
    "ETH and WETH are priced from Chainlink's standard ETH / USD feed (path eth-usd: 8 decimals, heartbeat 3,600 s, deviation 0.5%, aggregator 0x7d4E7420... at the verification block). Its SVR variants (eth-usd-svr 0x5147eA64..., eth-usd-shared-svr 0xd82562bb...) are not read. Ethereum has no sequencer: the heartbeat alone gates the price.",
    "USDC is Circle's FiatTokenProxy; its code hash is the proxy's. decimals() 6 and symbol() USDC at the verification block.",
    "The v3 factory enables the four standard tiers only: feeAmountTickSpacing(200), (300) and (400) answered 0 at the verification block (Base alone adds them).",
    "StateView.poolManager() is the PoolManager above at the verification block."
